s=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001605500</span>1,605<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a></b>, Crafted from various challenge ingredients\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +3</a>:</b> This item surrounds the wearer with an invisible but tangible field of force, granting +3 armor bonus to AC, just as though he were wearing armor.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +54</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +54</a>:</b> Passive: +54 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Cold <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +8%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +8</a>:</b> Passive: Your Cold spells gain a 8% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Freezing_Ice\" title=\"Freezing Ice\">Minor Freezing Ice </a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Freezing_Ice\" title=\"Freezing Ice\">Minor Freezing Ice </a>: </b><ul><li><b>On items:</b> While you are wearing this item, your melee, ranged, and unarmed attacks gain the Minor Freezing Ice ability. (When the weapon is used, an icy power occasionally comes to the surface, attempting to freeze an enemy solid and encase them in ice.) - (duration: 5 seconds)</li><li><b>On weapons:</b> This Weapon stores the pitiless immovable power of the ice deep within. When this weapon is used, this power occasionally comes to the surface, attempting to freeze an enemy solid and encase them in ice.</li></ul></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Frozen_Tunic_(Level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Frozen_Tunic_%28Level_4%29.png/420px-Frozen_Tunic_%28Level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"463\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Frozen_Tunic_%28Level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This tunic shimmers like frost and is filled with a powerful freezing energy. It will invest your attacks with an icy edge, as well as boosting the power of your ice-related magic. A bound Water Elemental fuels this item.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p><b>See also:</b> <a href=\"/page/Frozen_Tunic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frozen Tunic\">Frozen Tunic</a> - Full table of the Frozen Tunic line\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816164727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3626/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26576/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7830/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n172.11%  232.116     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  134.865      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  134.865      1 -total\n 96.63%  130.318      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 58.82%   79.327      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 58.26%   78.568      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 56.88%   76.709      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 55.37%   74.669      2 Template:InCategory\n 16.80%   22.662      7 Template:Popup\n 12.61%   17.009      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:23236-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816164727 and revision id 686705. Rendering was triggered because